      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1368840188,
      "text": "Peucedanum ostruthium or Imperatoria ostruthium, masterwort, is a species of flowering plant in the family Apiaceae. It is native to the mountains of Central and Southern Europe, but has been widely introduced outside its native range."
    },
    "es": {
